rocksdb provides CMake targets:

  find_package(RocksDB CONFIG REQUIRED)
  target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE $<IF:$<TARGET_EXISTS:RocksDB::rocksdb-shared>,RocksDB::rocksdb-shared,RocksDB::rocksdb>)

On Windows, the shared library exposes only the C API. Use a static triplet for the C++ API.

rocksdb provides pkg-config modules:

  # An embeddable persistent key-value store for fast storage
  rocksdb
